Static checks and release build (Node 24)	Run npm run release:check:static	2026-10-23T11:08:48.6004989Z what it does:
Static checks and release build (Node 24)	Run npm run release:check:static	2026-10-23T11:08:48.6005636Z   Picks a task recipe whose current surface (kind, when_to_use, body) has not
Static checks and release build (Node 24)	Run npm run release:check:static	2026-10-23T11:08:48.6007080Z   been judged, takes up to --cases of the tasks it was credited on, and runs
Static checks and release build (Node 24)	Run npm run release:check:static	2026-10-23T11:08:48.6008093Z   each task twice through the ordinary runner: once on a copy of the catalog
Static checks and release build (Node 24)	Run npm run release:check:static	2026-10-23T11:08:48.6009041Z   holding the recipe, once on a copy without it. Store, workspace and runs
Static checks and release build (Node 24)	Run npm run release:check:static	2026-10-23T11:08:48.6009929Z   directory are copies too, and learning is off. The verdict reads what the
Static checks and release build (Node 24)	Run npm run release:check:static	2026-10-23T11:08:48.6010811Z   runs delivered; a recipe that delivered nothing on two or more matched
Static checks and release build (Node 24)	Run npm run release:check:static	2026-10-23T11:08:48.6011629Z   cases where the run without it delivered is RETIRED from the catalog.
Static checks and release build (Node 24)	Run npm run release:check:static	2026-10-23T11:08:48.6012901Z   Everything else is recorded and kept. Record: supervisor/assays/<recipe>/assay.json;
Static checks and release build (Node 24)	Run npm run release:check:static	2026-10-23T11:08:48.6013761Z   journal: one supervisor.assay row.
Static checks and release build (Node 24)	Run npm run release:check:static	2026-10-23T11:08:48.6014048Z 
